# Build context hygiene.
#
# Without this file `COPY . .` ships ~6.8 GB to the daemon: the venv, the
# generated datasets, the DOTA val split and the 397 MB artifact zip are all
# sitting in the working tree. The image needs the source and the committed
# brief corpus, nothing else. Inputs that are deliberately not in git (the INT8
# graph, the val tiles) are mounted at run time instead - see README.

# Python environments and caches
.venv/
venv/
env/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# VCS and editor state
.git/
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# OS noise
.DS_Store
._*

# Generated datasets and training output (regenerate with data/dota_prep.py)
osp_dataset/
osp_dataset_*/
data/input_debug/
runs/
*.npy

# DOTA artifacts pulled from the Kaggle run: mounted at run time, not baked in
val/
osp_dota_artifacts.zip
model/artifacts/
model/artifacts_synthetic_backup/

# Runtime state that must not be baked into an image
ground/osp_memory.db
rag/vector_store/
/output/

# Stray export temporaries
sym_shape_infer_temp.onnx
*.onnx
